Description: IPTV player for deepin built with Qt 6 and DTK 6
 Plays IPTV channels from M3U/M3U8 playlists. It only plays streams: it does
 not host, bundle or distribute any channel or playlist.
 .
 The public playlist catalogue of the iptv-org project is downloaded on first
 start, and the user can add their own playlists by URL or from a local file.
 .
 Features: favourites, channel search, channel up/down like a TV, a scanner
 that finds which channels work and can hide the rest, and software or
 hardware decoding.
